<title>USA: U.S. DAP prices mixed in very light trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP prices mixed in very light trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate prices were mixed Wednesday in light trade.</p>
<p>The central Florida market should see more activity when rain in the Midwest lets up and farmers get back in their fields, cash souces said.</p>
<p>			    Dlrs/short ton	Chg from Monday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   179-180			up 2-dn 2</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     182-184			unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	   210-225			dn 20</p>
<p>--(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
</text>
